{"path":"chrono/time_point/time_point","title":"std::chrono::time_point<Clock,Duration>::time_point","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::time_point&lt;Clock,Duration&gt;::</span>time_point","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/time_point/time_point","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs a new time_point from one of several optional data sources.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(1)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">time_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(2)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> time_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> duration<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> d <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(3)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Duration2 <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>time_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> time_point<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Clock, Duration2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> t <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <code>time_point</code> from one of several optional data sources.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Default constructor, creates a <code>time_point</code> representing the <code>Clock</code>'s epoch (i.e., <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/time_point/time_since_epoch\">time_since_epoch()</a></span> is zero).</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Constructs a <code>time_point</code> at <code>Clock</code>'s epoch plus <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">d</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Constructs a <code>time_point</code> by converting <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">t</span></code> to <code>duration</code>. This constructor only participates in overload resolution if <code>Duration2</code> is implicitly convertible to <code>duration</code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> d\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>duration</code> to copy from\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> t\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>time_point</code> to convert from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Clock <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/steady_clock\"><span class=\"kw1013\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">steady_clock</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> TimePoint <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/time_point\"><span class=\"kw995\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">time_point</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Clock<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print_ms<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> TimePoint<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> point<span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Ms <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1000\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">milliseconds</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Clock<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span> since_epoch <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> point.<span class=\"me1\">time_since_epoch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/duration_cast\"><span class=\"kw1008\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration_cast</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Ms<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>since_epoch<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> TimePoint default_value <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> TimePoint<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// (1)</span>\n    print_ms<span class=\"br0\">(</span>default_value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 0ms</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Clock<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span> duration_4_seconds <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> TimePoint time_point_4_seconds<span class=\"br0\">(</span>duration_4_seconds<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// (2)</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// 4 seconds from start of epoch</span>\n    print_ms<span class=\"br0\">(</span>time_point_4_seconds<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 4000ms</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> TimePoint time_point_now <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Clock<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">now</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// (3)</span>\n    print_ms<span class=\"br0\">(</span>time_point_now<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 212178842ms</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0ms\n4000ms\n212178842ms</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/duration\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs new duration <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::chrono::duration&lt;Rep,Period&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/duration_cast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>duration_cast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a duration to another, with a different tick interval <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/time_point","title":"std::chrono::time_point"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::time_point<Clock,Duration>::time_point","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Constructs a new time_point from one of several optional data sources."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"d, t"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs new duration"},{"label":"duration_cast","note":"converts a duration to another, with a different tick interval"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++14"],"wordCount":212,"codeBlockCount":2}
